lot of certificates. We clearly know that with these certificates can prove our capability and quality pump.</p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: What’s your advantage? Why we choose you?</strong></p><p>A: 1) 20 Years experience of pump production and R&amp;D. We have the most professional techniques and team.</p><p>2) Sustainable Supply. According to customer requirements, we can support the customized include package.</p><p>3) Competitive price offered</p><p><strong>2. Q: What are your payment terms?</strong></p><p>A: T/T, L/C, D/P, D/A, Western Union, Money Gram, Paypal are all available!</p><p><strong>3. Q: How important is it to use a safety rope or cable?</strong></p><p>A: It is very important for you to use a safety rope or cable. We recommend a good stainless steel cable rather than rope. Rope (even nylon rope) can degrade over time in the damp environment of a well.</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: submersible wastewater pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/3-inch-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"3 Inch Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-inch-submersible-pump43410530621a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/3-inch-submersible-pump\">3 Inch Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/monoblock-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Monoblock Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/monoblock-submersible-pump03345316180a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/monoblock-submersible-pump\">Monoblock Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-submersible-impeller-pump/water-pump-impeller\"><img alt=\"Water P